<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 278-8 V INDIA IN TRIANGULAR SERIES FINAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 278-8 V INDIA IN TRIANGULAR SERIES FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 278 for eight</p>
<p>from their 50 overs against India in the replayed day/night</p>
<p>final of the triangular series at Kingsmead on Thursday.</p>
</text>
